{
  "scenario_name": "maian_vehicle_room_drive_smoke",
  "description": "The Maian hover vehicle driven where no mission can end the ride (B-1241). The same vehicle, inputs and checks as maian_vehicle_drive_smoke, which runs on Escape, where the mission's own script now takes the player out of the vehicle a second after it moves. Here the level is the Blank Room (dev-mods/blank_room) with a hoverbike that Forge's level document adds at boot (--debug-forge-level-vehicle: the hoverbike record every base hoverbike has, 600 units in front of the first start, facing the room), saved as the level 'Vehicle_Room' and played in a Combat Simulator match with no simulants. The hoverbike takes the Maian vehicle's model (--debug-swap-vehicle), Player 0 is put in the driver seat, accelerates for 1.4 s and steers right for 1.2 s, and must still be riding at the end: any dismount fails the run. What this proves beyond the Escape smoke: a level made by Forge places a vehicle a player can ride, in a match.",
